        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 border-l-4 border-brand-500 bg-brand-50/60 rounded-r-lg p-5 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        Networks the paper points to as models: <strong>PRISM</strong> in the United States, and <strong>Vac4EU</strong> and
        <a href={`${base}/open-source/`} class="text-brand-700 font-semibold hover:underline">DARWIN EU</a> in Europe.
        Closer to home, Taiwan already links its
        <a href={`${base}/nhird/#registry-covid`} class="text-brand-700 font-semibold hover:underline">COVID-19 vaccination registry</a> and
        <a href={`${base}/nhird/#registry-niis`} class="text-brand-700 font-semibold hover:underline">National Immunization Information System</a>
